    },
    "equivalence_margin": 1.08,
    "equivalence_rationale": "The pilot-derived resolution exceeds the five percent a consumer dominated by these calls would act on, so the margin is the smallest two-decimal value strictly above one plus that resolution. Within it the two builds are reported as interchangeable for a consumer; a smaller difference lies below what this family resolves.",
